  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/daycount\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1233297?logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=black&amp;label=&amp;labelColor=orange&amp;color=242424\" alt=\"CurseForge 下載次數\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fdaycount\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/daycount?style=flat&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=black&amp;label=&amp;labelColor=18ED49&amp;color=242424\" alt=\"Modrinth 下載次數\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/daycount\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/1233297(4F21AC).svg\" alt=\"支援版本\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/rSVp3nCpPx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1388544059114786907?style=flat&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=&amp;labelColor=blue\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fD1D71EVQVC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Ko--fi-75D5E3?logo=ko-fi\" alt=\"靜態徽章\"></a></p><h2>天數計數器 (Day Count) （Forge / NeoForge / Fabric）</h2><p>一個輕量級 HUD，顯示您的 Minecraft 世界中經過的天數。適用於「100 天」挑戰或追蹤長期生存進度。</p><h3>功能特色：</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>位置調整：</strong>可調整 X 和 Y 座標，將計數器放置在任何位置。</li>\n<li><strong>外觀設定：</strong>可自訂文字顏色與縮放倍率。</li>\n<li><strong>自訂文字：</strong>可將「Day: 」前綴替換為任何字串。</li>\n</ul><h3>設定檔位置：</h3><p>設定檔位於您的 <code>/config</code> 資料夾中：</p><ul>\n<li><strong>Forge / NeoForge：</strong><code>daycount-client.toml</code></li>\n<li><strong>Fabric：</strong><code>daycount.json5</code></li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1233297/description_62d1de14-7366-497a-a585-a44452c05111.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>1.5.0 及更新版本的背景框（具透明度）：</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1233297/description_15e6a013-c071-4c2f-925b-7a4e1d0a20a2.png\" width=\"625\" height=\"371\"></p>",
